<title>USA: Des Moines, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Des Moines, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $21.680 million of Des Moines, Iowa, water revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.43 percent.</p>
